=head1 DESCRIPTION

This is the top-level field for specifying vertex or edge filters. If
the ExportFilter is not provided, then all properties for all labels
will be exported. If the ExportFilter is provided but is an empty
object, then no data will be exported.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 EdgeFilter => L<Paws::NeptuneGraph::ExportFilterPerLabelMap>

Used to specify filters on a per-label basis for edges. This allows you
to control which edge labels and properties are included in the export.


=head2 VertexFilter => L<Paws::NeptuneGraph::ExportFilterPerLabelMap>

Used to specify filters on a per-label basis for vertices. This allows
you to control which vertex labels and properties are included in the
export.



